window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Yuki Tanaka is done playing it safe. A young reporter fed up with fluff pieces, she finally lands a real assignment: go undercover and expose the elusive Akira Sato, a powerful underworld figure feared across Tokyo. But the moment Yuki lays eyes on Akira’s file, something shifts. A strange, magnetic pull begins—one she can’t explain and dares not trust. </p> <p>To infiltrate Akira’s world, Yuki takes a job at a glamorous nightclub she’s known to frequent. Her charm and wit earn her a coveted role as Akira’s personal server. When a tense night forces a direct meeting, Akira—intrigued by Yuki’s poise under pressure—offers her a promotion: personal assistant. </p> <p>With her handler’s blessing, Yuki dives deeper, determined to gather intel. But what begins as a mission turns murky fast. Every encounter with Akira sparks undeniable tension. What should be calculated manipulation becomes dangerously real. When a private lunch shifts into something more intimate, Yuki finds herself caught between duty and desire. One night of passion threatens to unravel everything.</p>"; 
